sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as 客户端<br/>Flutter/Web
    participant Nginx as Nginx :80/:443
    participant Cors as Cors<br/>Middleware
    participant Security as Security<br/>Middleware
    participant RateLimit as RateLimit<br/>Middleware
    participant Pre as 预处理管道<br/>④-⑧
    participant Route as 路由分发
    participant Poster as PosterVerify<br/>路由级
    participant JWT as JwtAuth<br/>路由级
    participant Controller as Controller
    participant Model as Model<br/>BaseModel
    participant MySQL as MySQL 8.0
    participant Redis as Redis 7
    participant ES as ES 8
    participant Response as Response<br/>HashidsEncode<br/>+ Encryption

    Client->>Nginx: HTTP Request<br/>api.erik.xyz/api/v1/...
    Nginx->>Cors: 转发请求

    rect rgb(227, 242, 253)
        Note over Cors: ① CORS 跨域处理
        Cors->>Cors: 设置 Access-Control-* 响应头<br/>OPTIONS 预检返回 200
    end

    Cors->>Security: ② 安全检测
    rect rgb(255, 205, 210)
        Note over Security: ② SecurityMiddleware WAF
        Security->>Security: Content-Type 校验
        Security->>Security: Body Size ≤ 10MB
        Security->>Security: XSS 检测 13规则
        Security->>Security: SQLi 检测 13规则
        Security->>Security: CRLF Header 注入
        Security->>Security: Path Traversal
    end

    alt 攻击命中
        Security-->>Client: 4xxxx 错误响应
    end

    Security->>RateLimit: ③ 限流检查

    rect rgb(255, 249, 196)
        Note over RateLimit: 令牌桶限流
        RateLimit->>Redis: ZADD + ZREMRANGEBYSCORE<br/>滑动窗口计数
        Redis-->>RateLimit: 当前窗口请求数
        RateLimit->>RateLimit: 7 条端点规则 + 默认 60s/100<br/>password/reset 300s/5<br/>同邮箱失败 5 次锁定 30min
    end

    alt 超限
        RateLimit-->>Client: 429 Retry-After
    end

    RateLimit->>Pre: ④ Platform → ⑧ VersionRoute

    rect rgb(227, 242, 253)
        Note over Pre: 请求预处理阶段
        Pre->>Pre: ④ Platform 来源识别
        Pre->>Pre: ⑤ GeoIp 区域/币种
        Pre->>Pre: ⑥ Locale 语言设置
        Pre->>Pre: ⑦ HashidsDecode ID解码
        Pre->>Pre: ⑧ VersionRoute API版本
    end

    Pre->>Route: 路由匹配
    Route->>Route: API-Version → 命名空间<br/>Controller 匹配

    alt 敏感操作 注册/下单/支付
        Route->>Poster: 路由级 人机验证
        Poster->>Redis: GET poster_token:{key}
        Redis-->>Poster: token
        alt 验证失败
            Poster-->>Client: 40007 验证失败
        end
    end

    alt 需认证接口
        Route->>JWT: 路由级 Bearer Token
        JWT->>JWT: HS256 验签 + 过期检查
        alt Token 无效
            JWT-->>Client: 401 Unauthorized
        end
        JWT->>Controller: request→userId
    end

    Route->>Controller: 业务处理

    rect rgb(200, 230, 201)
        Note over Controller,ES: 业务逻辑处理
        Controller->>Model: 调用 Model
        Model->>Model: Snowflake ID 生成
        Model->>Model: Encryptable 加密/解密
        Model->>MySQL: 读写操作
        MySQL-->>Model: 结果
        Model->>ES: 搜索/索引
        ES-->>Model: 搜索结果
        Model-->>Controller: 业务数据
    end

    Controller->>Response: 返回数据

    rect rgb(187, 222, 251)
        Note over Response: 响应后处理
        Response->>Response: ⑨ HashidsEncode ID编码
        Response->>Response: ⑩ Encryption 加密敏感字段
        Response->>Response: JSON {code, msg, data}<br/>Cache-Control: no-store, no-cache, must-revalidate
    end

    Response->>Nginx: HTTP Response
    Nginx->>Client: JSON + CORS + X-Platform<br/>Cache-Control: no-store
